@page "/auth/denied"
@layout MainLayout
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@* Where a sign-in lands when the identity provider authenticated somebody this instance
   does not admit. Anonymous by necessity: they have no session, and sending them back to
   the login they just failed would bounce them between the two forever. *@
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>No access — Gatherum</PageTitle>

<h1>No access</h1>
<p>
    You signed in successfully, but this Gatherum does not admit your account. Access is
    granted by group membership at the identity provider, so whoever administers it can
    add you.
</p>
